		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ghostly skull, undead residue made when a powerful psychic is slain by violence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 18, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +6 (essence drain), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Essence Drain</strong>. 1d4 CHA damage, coma at 0 CHA.</p><p></p><p><strong>Formless</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal. Even if incorporeal, can be seen and attacked by those it has damaged with essence drain.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
